  "body_html": "<p>Maarschalk, je Ploeg is standaard een half dozijn sterk. Behandel hen als een volgeling met het kenmerk <em>groep</em> . Alle startwaarden hier kunnen in het spel veranderen.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">De Ploeg</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Max. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Max. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Pantser\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Pantser</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Schade\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Schade werpen\">Schade</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP begint op 6 per lid; Pantser op 0; Schade op d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Kenmerken</h3>\n<p>Je ploeg start met <em>groep</em>, een kenmerk uit je achtergrond, plus 2 extra naar keuze.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>boogschutters</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>atletisch</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>dapper</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>sluw</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>toegewijd</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Begint aangevinkt\"> <span><em>groep</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>gehard</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>intimiderend</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>opmerkzaam</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>geduldig</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>gerespecteerd</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>heimelijk</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>krijgers</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"zelf invullen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"zelf invullen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"zelf invullen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>uitzonderlijk</em> (vereist Helden tot het Laatst)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinct</h3>\n<p>Kies er 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Kibbelen, onderling vechten en wrok koesteren</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>Vasthouden aan traditie en bijgeloof</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Toegeven aan hun laagste instincten</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>De baas spelen over anderen</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Onnodige risico's nemen</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Dingen te ver doorvoeren</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"zelf invullen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Prijs</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Kies er 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Loyaliteit</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Loyaliteit 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Loyaliteit 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Loyaliteit 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Loyaliteit 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Loyaliteit 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Loyaliteit 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Feestvieren, met de hele ploeg</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Publieke erkenning en respect, eer</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Risico's die jij neemt om hen te helpen</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Overwinningen op waardige vijanden</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Rijkdom vergaard voor henzelf of Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"zelf invullen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inventaris</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ of minder is een lichte last; 4–6 ◇ is een normale last; 7–9 ◇ is een zware last.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Handbijl</strong>, ijzer (<em>hand</em>, <em>geworpen</em>, x doorborend)</li><li>◇ <strong>Speer</strong>, ijzer (<em>dichtbij</em>, <em>geworpen</em>, x doorborend)</li><li>◇ <strong>Boog &amp; ijzeren pijlen</strong> (<em>nabij</em>, x doorborend, ○ weinig munitie, ○ helemaal op)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Schild</strong> (+1 pantser, +1 Paraatheid bij 7+ bij Verdedigen)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Dikke huiden</strong> (1 pantser, <em>warm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Mantel</strong> (<em>warm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Voorraden</strong> (4+Welvaart gebruiken per ploeglid)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Voorraden</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Gebruik 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Gebruik 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Gebruik 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Gebruik 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Gebruik 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Gebruik 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Gebruik 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Gebruik 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Gebruik 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Gebruik 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Gebruik 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Gebruik 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Gebruik 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Gebruik 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Gebruik 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Gebruik 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Gebruik 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Gebruik 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Gebruik 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Gebruik 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Gebruik 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Gebruik 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Gebruik 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Gebruik 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Gebruik 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Overige uitrusting</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Individuen</h3>\n<p>Wanneer iemand opvalt, geef diegene een naam, een kenmerk en een of meer trekken.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Naam</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"naam\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kenmerk</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"kenmerk\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Trekken</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"trekken\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Naam</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"naam\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kenmerk</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"kenmerk\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Trekken</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"trekken\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Naam</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"naam\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kenmerk</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"kenmerk\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Trekken</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"trekken\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Naam</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"naam\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kenmerk</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"kenmerk\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Trekken</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"trekken\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Naam</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"naam\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kenmerk</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"kenmerk\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Trekken</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"trekken\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Naam</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"naam\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kenmerk</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"kenmerk\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Trekken</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"trekken\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Namen:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Kenmerken:</strong> <em>dierenvriend, groot, pestkop, cynisch, drinkebroer, gretig, gokker, hebzuchtig, knorrig, goedgelovig, hartenbreker, eerlijk, vriendelijk, schunnig, klein, naïef, oud, populair, trots, groentje, roekeloos, schaamteloos, scherpe ogen, opvliegend</em></p>\n<p><strong>Trekken:</strong> kind/broer of zus/ouder/neef van ___, kaal, verliefd op ___, wrok tegen ___, haat ___, verafgoodt ___, maakt grappen, slordig, mist een oog/vinger/hand/___, mist zijn kinderen, nachtmerries, pas getrouwd, vroom, littekens, broodmager, scherpe tong, zingt, snurkt, vertelt sterke verhalen, te serieus, problemen thuis, fluit, houtsnijder</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notities</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notities\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Volgelingen Aansturen</h3>\n<p>Wanneer je <strong><em>hen opdraagt een zet te doen en zij dat doen</em></strong>, werp +1 in plaats van +STAT als een van hun kenmerken van toepassing is (of +2 als ze bovendien <em>uitzonderlijk</em> zijn). Is geen kenmerk van toepassing, werp +0. Zou een van hun kenmerken in de weg zitten, werp dan met nadeel.</p>\n<p>Wanneer ze <strong><em>zonder orders</em></strong> zijn of <strong><em>op eigen houtje handelen</em></strong>, zegt de SL wat ze doen en hoe dat uitpakt.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Versterk je Band</h3>\n<p>Wanneer je <strong><em>hun prijs betaalt</em></strong> en dat niet onlangs nog hebt gedaan, houden ze +1 Loyaliteit (max. 3).</p>\n<p>Besteed hun Loyaliteit 1-op-1 om hen:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Hun angst te laten overwinnen en te doen wat je zegt</li><li>Niet te laten handelen naar hun instinct/kenmerken/trekken</li><li>Iets te laten doen wat ze niet willen (zolang het niet weerzinwekkend of zelfmoord is)</li></ul>"
}
